{"page": "travel", "wix": {"base": "g7ds0", "title": "NEW Travel", "slug": "travel", "seoTitle": "Travel & Parking | Getting to the Hilton Anaheim · AC2027", "seoDesc": "Airports, driving routes, trains and parking for the Antiochian Archdiocese Convention, July 19–25, 2027 at the Hilton Anaheim. The closest airport is SNA.", "keep": [4, 5]}, "secs": [{"id": "comp-mw3c3wtk1", "h": 432, "bg": "#faf8f5", "img": "", "els": [{"t": "ce", "p": [0, 10, 980, 77], "tag": "ac-header", "a": {"current": "", "compact": "1"}}, {"t": "ce", "p": [-266, 87, 1512, 36], "tag": "ac-newsbar", "a": {"dock": "bottom"}}, {"t": "text", "p": [0, 147, 980, 189], "bl": [{"b": "h1", "s": "O|49|400|53.9|0.49|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["TRAVEL & PARKING"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["GETTING TO THE HILTON ANAHEIM"]]}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|20|300|33|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Airports, driving routes, trains and parking for the 58th Biennial Antiochian Archdiocese Convention, July 19–25, 2027 at the Hilton Anaheim, 777 W Convention Way, Anaheim, CA 92802."]]}, {"sp": 12}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|13|400|19.994|0|#6b6890|s|||", "r": [["Updated November 2026"]]}]}]}, {"id": "comp-mw3c3wtm6", "h": 639, "bg": "#0d0745", "img": "", "els": [{"t": "text", "p": [0, 94, 604, 326], "bl": [{"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#fdce3e|s|||", "r": [["ONE THING FIRST"]]}, {"b": "h2", "s": "O|39|400|44.85|0|#faf8f5|s|||", "r": [["The Convention is in Anaheim, not Riverside"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|20|300|33|0|#faf8f5|s|||", "r": [["The host parish, "], ["Saint Andrew Orthodox Christian Church", "P|20|300|33|0|#fdce3e|s|||", "/host-parish"], [", is in Riverside. The Convention itself is at the Hilton Anaheim."]]}, {"sp": 26}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#e1dee3|s|||", "r": [["Riverside is about 35 to 40 miles from the hotel by road: 45 minutes to an hour off-peak, and longer at rush hour. Hotels near the parish are not near the Convention, so book your room in Anaheim, inside the "], ["Convention block", "P|16|400|26.4|0|#fdce3e|s|||", "/hotel"], ["."]]}]}, {"t": "text", "p": [636, 94, 344, 22], "bl": [{"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#fdce3e|s|||", "r": [["AT A GLANCE"]]}]}, {"t": "box", "p": [636, 132, 344, 108], "bg": "#faf8f5", "br": "14px", "bd": "", "sh": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18) 0px 6px 18px 0px"}, {"t": "text", "p": [656, 146, 304, 79], "bl": [{"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["ADDRESS"]]}, {"sp": 4}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|500|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Hilton Anaheim, 777 W Convention Way, Anaheim, CA 92802"]]}]}, {"t": "box", "p": [636, 250, 344, 108], "bg": "#faf8f5", "br": "14px", "bd": "", "sh": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18) 0px 6px 18px 0px"}, {"t": "text", "p": [656, 264, 304, 79], "bl": [{"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["CLOSEST AIRPORT"]]}, {"sp": 4}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|500|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["John Wayne / Orange County (SNA), about 14 miles"]]}]}, {"t": "box", "p": [636, 368, 344, 82], "bg": "#faf8f5", "br": "14px", "bd": "", "sh": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18) 0px 6px 18px 0px"}, {"t": "text", "p": [656, 382, 304, 53], "bl": [{"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["BY CAR"]]}, {"sp": 4}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|500|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Just off Interstate 5"]]}]}, {"t": "box", "p": [636, 460, 344, 82], "bg": "#faf8f5", "br": "14px", "bd": "", "sh": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18) 0px 6px 18px 0px"}, {"t": "text", "p": [656, 474, 304, 53], "bl": [{"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["ROOM BLOCK"]]}, {"sp": 4}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|500|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["July 17–25, $209 a night. "], ["Reserve", "P|16|400|26.4|0|#90294f|s|||", "/hotel"]]}]}]}, {"id": "comp-mw3c3wto4", "h": 1368, "bg": "#faf8f5", "img": "", "els": [{"t": "text", "p": [0, 84, 680, 1220], "bl": [{"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["GETTING HERE"]]}, {"b": "h2", "s": "O|39|400|44.85|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Eight ways in, and where to park"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "h3", "s": "O|24|400|31.2|0.48|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["1. Fly into John Wayne (SNA)"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["John Wayne Airport / Orange County is the closest, about 14 miles from the hotel. It is usually the easiest arrival, especially from the West and the Mountain states."]]}, {"sp": 30}, {"b": "h3", "s": "O|24|400|31.2|0.48|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["2. Or Long Beach (LGB)"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Long Beach Airport is about 18 to 20 miles away and worth checking for fares."]]}, {"sp": 30}, {"b": "h3", "s": "O|24|400|31.2|0.48|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["3. LAX and Ontario (ONT) work too"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Los Angeles International (LAX) and Ontario International (ONT) are each about 35 miles from the hotel. Allow extra time from LAX in afternoon traffic. Ontario is the closest airport to Riverside."]]}, {"sp": 30}, {"b": "h3", "s": "O|24|400|31.2|0.48|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["4. Driving from Los Angeles"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Take I-5 South and exit at Harbor Boulevard, then follow signs to Convention Way. It is about 26 miles from downtown Los Angeles, roughly 35 minutes without traffic."]]}, {"sp": 30}, {"b": "h3", "s": "O|24|400|31.2|0.48|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["5. Driving from San Diego"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Take I-5 North and exit at Katella Avenue, turn left on Harbor Boulevard, then right on Convention Way. It is about 95 miles, close to two hours."]]}, {"sp": 30}, {"b": "h3", "s": "O|24|400|31.2|0.48|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["6. Driving from Riverside and the Inland Empire"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Take SR-91 West to SR-57 South, exit at Katella Avenue and head west to Harbor Boulevard. SR-91 is one of the busiest corridors in the region, so plan around rush hour."]]}, {"sp": 30}, {"b": "h3", "s": "O|24|400|31.2|0.48|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["7. By train"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Amtrak’s Pacific Surfliner and Metrolink’s Orange County Line stop at ARTIC, Anaheim’s regional transit center, about three miles from the hotel. Metrolink runs mostly on weekdays; check the timetable before you plan a weekend arrival. A taxi or rideshare covers the last few miles."]]}, {"sp": 30}, {"b": "h3", "s": "O|24|400|31.2|0.48|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["8. Parking at the Hilton Anaheim"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Self-parking and valet are available in the covered garage behind the hotel, with a maximum vehicle height of 6′8″. Daily rates are set by the hotel and change, so confirm the current rate when you book."]]}, {"sp": 30}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|400|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Once you’re here, nearly everything happens under one roof."]]}]}, {"t": "text", "p": [764, 84, 216, 472], "bl": [{"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["PLAN YOUR WEEK"]]}, {"sp": 16}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|500|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Hotel & room block →", "", "/hotel"]]}, {"sp": 12}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|500|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Registration →", "", "/registration"]]}, {"sp": 12}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|500|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Schedule →", "", "/schedule"]]}, {"sp": 12}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|500|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["FAQ →", "", "/faq"]]}, {"sp": 12}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|16|500|26.4|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["All guides →", "", "/guides"]]}, {"sp": 12}, {"sp": 14}, {"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["THE ESSENTIALS"]]}, {"sp": 12}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|15|500|24.75|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["July 19–25, 2027"]]}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|15|400|24.75|0|#6b6890|s|||", "r": [["Hilton Anaheim, 777 W Convention Way, Anaheim, CA 92802"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|15|400|24.75|0|#6b6890|s|||", "r": [["$209 a night in the Convention block, July 17–25"]]}, {"sp": 10}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|15|400|24.75|0|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["info@ac2027socal.com", "", "mailto:info@ac2027socal.com"]]}]}]}, {"id": "comp-mw3c3wtp9", "h": 386, "bg": "#f2f0ef", "img": "", "els": [{"t": "text", "p": [0, 84, 980, 70], "bl": [{"b": "p", "s": "O|13|400|20.8|2.6|#90294f|s|||", "r": [["MORE GUIDES"]]}, {"b": "h2", "s": "O|39|400|44.85|0|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["Keep planning"]]}]}, {"t": "text", "p": [0, 218, 300, 86], "bl": [{"b": "h3", "s": "O|20|400|26|0.6|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["First-Timer’s Guide", "", "/first-timers-guide"]]}, {"sp": 8}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|15|400|24.75|0|#6b6890|s|||", "r": [["Ten things to know before your first Archdiocese Convention."]]}]}, {"t": "text", "p": [340, 218, 300, 86], "bl": [{"b": "h3", "s": "O|20|400|26|0.6|#0d0745|s|||", "r": [["A Day in Riverside", "", "/riverside"]]}, {"sp": 8}, {"b": "p", "s": "P|15|400|24.75|0|#6b6890|s|||", "r": [["Visit the host parish and seven landmarks of its home city."]]}]}]}, "COPY:hotel:4", "FOOTER:659"]}